BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Communicating Across the Cosmos
DTSTART:20261017T000000
DTEND:20261017T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:5dd19b9dbd3f4d0d2aabbb989fae9d@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Date: Saturday\, October 17\, 2026 Time: 10:00 am – 5:00 pm 
 We’re talking to an astronaut! After we speak to space earlier in the we
 ek (date TBD)\, come celebrate our International Space Station chat with s
 pecial programs\, an opportunity to learn about ham radio\, and a full rep
 lay of the cosmic conversation. All day\, we’ll explore and experiment w
 ith the radio technology that is enabling students to speak with an astron
 aut in outer space from the EcoTarium. Learn More & Get Tickets Our Intern
 ational Space Station contact will take place during the week of October 1
 2\, with the final date determined by NASA in early October. The EcoTarium
  Website will be updated once we know the contact date. The program schedu
 le is subject to change if the contact takes place on Saturday\, October 1
 7. To learn more about the EcoTarium’s contact with astronauts on the In
 ternational Space Station\, click here. Sources: Discover Central Massachu
 setts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/communicating-ac
 ross-the-cosmos/30754/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough
 \, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSour
 ce page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/communicating-across-the-
 cosmos/30754/
LOCATION:EcoTarium\, 222 Harrington Way\, Worcester\, MA\, 01604
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/communicating-across-the-cosmo
 s/30754/
END:VEVENT
