BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Knapping the First Tools
DTSTART:20261017T000000
DTEND:20261017T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:1488a14e5ac326a550fd9870f0ccbe@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Knapping\, or chipping sharp edges into stone\, is one of the 
 earliest known technologies. Millions of years ago\, our ancestors learned
  to shape stone tools for hunting and survival. In this workshop\, teens (
 ages 13–18) will explore how early stone tools were made and why they ma
 tter. Work with Dylan Flicker\, a PhD student in Archaeology\, to see how 
 striking a rock in just the right way can turn it into a useful tool. Try 
 your hand at safely shaping and using stone tools to understand the skill
 \, precision\, and problem-solving involved in this ancient technology. Pa
 rticipants attending this workshop should wear closed-toe shoes and long p
 ants. Teen Saturdays Workshops are offered bilingually in Spanish and Engl
 ish. They are designed to build community and improve the museum experienc
 e for multicultural teens. Snacks provided! $10 fee includes free admissio
 n to all HMSC museums immediately following the workshop. Teens will recei
 ve a free admission pass (worth $15) for a return visit if they attend one
  of the three sessions. October 17: Knapping the First Tools: Teen Saturda
 ys Workshop November 14: Making Paleolithic Cave Art December 12: Animal S
 tories from the Past Presented by the Peabody Museum of Archaeology & Ethn
 ology and the Harvard Museums of Science & Culture. LEARN MORE / GET TICKE
 TS Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/knapp
 ing-the-first-tools/93482/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northboro
 ugh\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nS
 ource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/knapping-the-first-tools/9348
 2/
LOCATION:Peabody Museum of Archaeology & Ethnology\, Harvard University\, 
 Peabody Museum of Archaeology & Ethnology\, Harvard University 11 Divinity
  Ave\, Cambridge\, MA\, 02138
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/knapping-the-first-tools/93482/
END:VEVENT
