BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Asa Waters Mansion Fall Fun Day
DTSTART:20261018T000000
DTEND:20261018T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:daebb341d495ffabb22f9bb536f08b@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:As the leaves begin to turn and autumn settles into the Blacks
 tone Valley\, Asa Waters Mansion invites the community to celebrate the se
 ason at our Fall Fun Day\, taking place on Sunday\, October 18th\, from 12
 :00pm to 5:00pm at the historic mansion\, located at 123 Elm Street\, Mill
 bury. This free\, family-friendly event will bring together local makers\,
  artisans\, farms\, food vendors\, community organizations and small busin
 esses for an afternoon filled with shopping\, music\, family fun\, food an
 d fall activities on the grounds of Asa Waters Mansion. “Our Fall fun Da
 y celebrates the wonderful people\, businesses and organizations that make
  our community special\,” said Traci Parath\, Executive Director of Asa 
 Waters Mansion. “It has quickly become one of our favorite community eve
 nts\, and is the perfect opportunity for our community to come together\, 
 for a festive day\, discover something new\, listen to great local music\,
  and simply spend an afternoon at the Mansion.” More than 40 local vendo
 rs will be featured throughout the event\, offering everything from handcr
 afted goods\, books\, pottery and artwork to specialty foods\, baked treat
 s\, candles\, jewelry\, flowers and more. Participating vendors include As
 a Waters Mansion Gift Shoppe\, Millbury Historical Society\, Manitou Farms
 \, Penny Pincher Brewery\, Stay Awhile Coffee\, Spicy Water Distillery\, T
 he Millbury Women’s Club\, The Raediate Company\, Wicked Beard Company\,
  and many other local makers and businesses. The afternoon will also featu
 re live performances throughout the event beginning with Lynn Anderson & S
 hawn Turner performing from 12:00pm to 2:00pm\, followed by Friends of Coo
 p from 2:30pm to 5:00pm. Families can enjoy additional activities\, includ
 ing Dr. Cornfish Caricatures from 1:00pm to 3:00pm and a friendly Town Dep
 artment Chili Cook-Off from 1:00pm to 4:00pm. Be sure to cast your vote\, 
 for your favorite chili\, where the winner will be announced at 5:00pm! Gu
 ests are encouraged to come hungry\, explore the vendors\, enjoy the music
  and take in the beauty of Asa Waters Mansion during one of the most pictu
 resque times of the year. Admission is free\, and the event is open to the
  public. For more information\, please contact Asa Waters Mansion Executiv
 e Director\, Traci Parath at 508.865.0855 or email Traci at\, tparath@mill
 buryma.gov. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://ww
 w.discovercentralma.org/event/asa-waters-mansion-fall-fun-day/31033/\n\nEv
 ents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local
  fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discover
 centralma.org/event/asa-waters-mansion-fall-fun-day/31033/
LOCATION:Asa Waters Mansion\, 123 Elm St.\, Millbury\, MA\, 01527
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/asa-waters-mansion-fall-fun-da
 y/31033/
END:VEVENT
