BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Esther in the Age of Rembrandt
DTSTART:20261018T000000
DTEND:20261018T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:2e033558848e54aba57cd6d70da411@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:In conjunction with the Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum's exhi
 bition\, ACRONYM presents Esther in the Age of Rembrandt on Sunday\, Octob
 er 18\, offering rare performances of three Esther cantatas written during
  Rembrandt's time. The program includes a work by the remarkable French co
 mposer Elisabeth Jacquet de La Guerre\, alongside music by Flemish compose
 r Leonora Duarte\, Jewish Mantuan composer Salamone Rossi\, Giacomo Cariss
 imi\, Johann Heinrich Schmelzer\, and Marc-Antoine Charpentier. ACRONYM wi
 ll perform with a roster of vocal soloists as special guests: Amanda Forsy
 the and Teresa Wakim\, sopranos\; Kim Leeds\, alto\; Aaron Sheehan\, tenor
 \; and Jesse Blumberg\, baritone. The Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum's Fa
 ll 2026 Weekend Concert Series features a ten-concert autumn season curate
 d by Abrams Curator of Music George Steel held on select Sundays from Sept
 ember 13 through November 22\, 2026. The fall season showcases world-class
  artists in the Museum's extraordinary Calderwood Hall-a 300-seat "sonic c
 ube" with three levels of balconies designed so that 80% of seats are fron
 t row\, creating a uniquely intense and intentional listening experience. 
 Dating to 1927\, the Gardner's Weekend Concert Series is the longest runni
 ng museum music program in the country. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS Sources: 
 Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/esther-in-the-age
 -of-rembrandt/93477/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, 
 MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource 
 page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/esther-in-the-age-of-rembrandt/9347
 7/
LOCATION:Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum\, 25 Evans Way\, Boston\, MA\, 02
 115
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/esther-in-the-age-of-rembrandt/93477/
END:VEVENT
