DESCRIPTION:Join HC Votes for our first student working group meeting as w
 e prepare for the 2026 midterm elections! HC Votes supports nonpartisan ca
 mpus voter engagement by connecting students with accurate\, timely inform
 ation about voter registration\, election deadlines\, and ways to particip
 ate in upcoming elections. As we look to increase awareness of the midterm
  elections at Holy Cross\, we’ll discuss opportunities to engage our pee
 rs\, promote the College’s TurboVote platform\, share voting resources\,
  and brainstorm ways to make civic participation more visible and accessib
 le on campus. No prior experience with voter engagement is necessary - jus
