BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:call for art: Small Works 2026\, A Members' Exhibition
DTSTART:20261021T000000
DTEND:20261021T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:52d9d8bc1251b313a1d1544474b116@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Call for art: Small Works 2026\, a non-juried exhibition open 
 to all ArtsWorcester artist members. // REGISTER HERE Registration Deadlin
 e: October 21\, 11:59 PM Drop-off period: October 28 - November 1\, or ear
 lier by appointment Exhibition Run: November 12 - December 13\, 2026 Publi
 c reception: Saturday\, November 14 To round out the year\, ArtsWorcester 
 members are invited to participate in Small Works 2026\, a non-juried memb
 ers’ exhibition. All wall-hanging artworks\, including sculptures that g
 o on the wall\, may not exceed 10” in any direction\, including frame. A
 rtworks that go on a pedestal may be no larger than 10” in height and 10
 ” at the widest point. Beyond the size limit\, there is no medium or the
 me requirement. All media are welcome\, including but not limited to paint
 ing\, sculpture\, photography\, fiber\, fine craft\, digital art\, and vid
 eo. This exhibition will draw many holiday shoppers\, as small gifts of ar
 t make wonderful presents (your piece does not have to be for sale\, of co
 urse). Pieces available for purchase must have a minimum price of at least
  $100. $500 in prizes will be awarded at the public reception. // LEARN MO
 RE AND REGISTER YOUR WORK HERE Registration is free for ArtsWorcester memb
 ers\, and membership to ArtsWorcester is required. All media are welcome\,
  including but not limited to painting\, sculpture\, photography\, fiber\,
  fine craft\, digital art\, and video. Have a question about submitting wo
 rk to one of our calls\, or about becoming a member? Call the gallery with
  any questions at (508)755-5142. Learn more about submission requirements 
 for Small Works 2026 here. (Pictured) Artworks from last year's Small Work
 s showcase: // Lia Vichi\, Memories of Food\, modeling clay\, wood\, fabri
 c\, 8″ x 4.5″ x 5″\, 2025 // Brandon Paquin\, Herbie\, spoons\, fork
 s\, deadwood (Mountain Laurel)\,steel\, epoxy\, acrylic paint\, 10” x 10
 ” x 5”\, 2025 // Ilana Londry\, Portrait\, charcoal on paper\, 8" x 9.
 5"\, 2022 // Patricia King\, Guitar Lessons with Jimmy Buffett\, recycled 
 book\, colored pencil\, glue\, 9.5" x 8"\, 2025 Sources: Discover Central 
 Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/call-for
 -art%3a-small-works-2026-a-members-exhibition/30271/\n\nEvents Near Me: wi
 thin 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from m
 assachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/ev
 ent/call-for-art%3a-small-works-2026-a-members-exhibition/30271/
LOCATION:ArtsWorcester\, 44 Portland St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/call-for-art%3a-small-works-20
 26-a-members-exhibition/30271/
END:VEVENT
