BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Club 321 featuring Albino Mbie
DTSTART:20261022T000000
DTEND:20261022T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:59815e3df9d553d417caa4c9537930@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Artist: Greg Piccolo A special event in partnership with 90.5 
 WICN’s Brian Barlow Series Join us at Club 321 for an unforgettable nigh
 t with blues and R&B legend Greg Piccolo. With a career spanning more than
  six decades\, Greg Piccolo has helped define the sound of American rhythm
  & blues with his unmistakable tenor saxophone tone and powerhouse vocals
 —evoking the golden era when “sax was king.” From forming his first 
 band at just 13 in Westerly\, Rhode Island\, to becoming one of the most r
 espected voices in the genre\, Piccolo has spent a lifetime dedicated to g
 roove\, grit\, and timeless musical storytelling. As a longtime leader and
  key creative force behind the acclaimed Roomful of Blues\, he helped shap
 e the band’s signature horn-driven sound\, leading them to international
  recognition\, Grammy nominations\, and worldwide touring success over a c
 elebrated 25-year run. In 1994\, he launched Heavy Juice\, a more intimate
  and flexible project that opened the door to deeper artistic exploration.
  Since then\, Greg has continued to tour\, record\, and evolve—deliverin
 g music rooted in tradition but alive with energy and swing. This Club 321
  performance is a rare chance to experience a true master of blues and R&B
  in an intimate setting. Expect big tone\, deep groove\, and a night of mu
 sic that moves from the first note to the last. Experience a different sid
 e of Mechanics Hall\, in our intimate Washburn Hall\, transformed one Thur
 sday night a month into your favorite club. Come sip handcrafted drinks fr
 om our full bar\, and enjoy cabaret-style seating. An unforgettable evenin
 g in the heart of downtown Worcester! ADDITIONAL INFORMATION General Admis
 sion Tickets: $30 VIP Ticket: $50 Enhance your Club 321 evening with premi
 um reserved table seating and one complimentary drink per ticket. Enjoy th
 e best views of the performance while relaxing in one of Worcester’s mos
 t unique listening room. VIP Ticket and Drink Ticket can be picked up at W
 ill Call on the night of the performance\, beginning at 6:15PM. Mechanics 
 Hall Members: 10% discount off single ticket Time: Doors 6:15pm | Show 7:0
 0pm Cash bar and refreshments available for purchase Sources: Discover Cen
 tral Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/clu
 b-321-featuring-albino-mbie/30393/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/club-321-featu
 ring-albino-mbie/30393/
LOCATION:Mechanics Hall\, 321 Main St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/club-321-featuring-albino-mbie
 /30393/
END:VEVENT
