  guests as Stitch introduces Angel for her shimmering on ice debut\, and p
 repare for a scene stealing entrance by the Disney Villains that will keep
  you on the edge of your seat. When the spotlight turns to celebrate you\,
  it's your moment to bask in the glitz\, excitement\, and enchantment of D
 isney On Ice presents Spotlight Magic! This all-new Disney On Ice producti
 on will skate into DCU Center in Worcester from October 22-25\, 2026. *Not
