DESCRIPTION:Worcester State University and the Visual and Performing Arts 
 Department present Hold Me Tender featuring the sculptures of Bayda Asbrid
 ge On view October 22 - November 21 at the Mary Cosgrove Dolphin Gallery. 
 Free and open to the public during gallery hours. Join us for the opening 
 reception on October 22 from 4-7 pm. All are welcome! An American artist w
 ith roots in the Middle East\, Bayda Asbridge’s series of boat sculpture
 s examines identity\, displacement\, and belonging. Using muted colors\, n
 atural materials\, and woven textures\, the boats—some shrouded\, others
  suspended or fractured—evoke both fragility and resilience. Sources: Di
 scover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org
