BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emi Ferguson: Flute Sonatas
DTSTART:20261023T000000
DTEND:20261023T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:86f65d56eb622818f9a34eb671fc02@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Emi Ferguson has performed with artists like Yo-Yo Ma and Paul
  Simon\, Baroque and Early Music ensembles like Handel & Haydn Society and
  Ruckus. After a wildly successful Music Worcester concert in July 2025\, 
 she returns for a complete performance of Bach’s Flute Sonatas \, a coll
 ection of works for the instrument with harpsichord. Bach’s Flute Sonata
 s are a treasure for the listener and an undertaking for the performer. Ri
 ch with a balance of lyricism and virtuosic elements\, hearing this progra
 m in full offers a delightful insight to the vast possibilities of what th
 e flute can do. In addition to J.S. Bach’s Flute Sonatas (BWV 1020\, 103
 0-32)\, she performs two CPE Bach sonatas: Sonata in G Major for Keyboard 
 and Flute\, Wq 85\, and Sonata in C Major for Keyboard and Flute\, Wq 87. 
 CPE Bach\, JS Bach’s fifth child\, was a pivotal composer during the tra
 nsition from Baroque to Classical eras. He wrote in a style similar to his
  father\, but pushed forward with the developing Classical trends of the t
 ime\; his writings and works would go on to be studied by Beethoven\, Moza
 rt\, and others. Program J.S. Bach – Sonata in Eb Major (1730)\, BWV 103
 1 CPE Bach – Sonata in C Major\, Wq 87 J.S. Bach – Sonata in G Minor (
 1740)\, BWV 1020 J.S. Bach – Sonata in A Major (1736) BWV 1032 CPE Bach 
 – Sonata in G Major\, Wq 85 J.S. Bach – Sonata in B Minor (1737)\, BWV
  1030 Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.disc
 overcentralma.org/event/emi-ferguson%3a-flute-sonatas/30209/\n\nEvents Nea
 r Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallbac
 k from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralm
 a.org/event/emi-ferguson%3a-flute-sonatas/30209/
LOCATION:6 Institute Rd\, Worcester\, MA\, 01609
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/emi-ferguson%3a-flute-sonatas/
 30209/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Evening of music with VioLynne
DTSTART:20261023T000000
DTEND:20261023T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:4cfb12348da9fd11f54e28f510199b@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Lynne Canavan is a professional violinist and jazz vocalist fr
 om Marlboro\, MA. As a violinist\, Lynne is a 25 year member of the Milfor
 d based Claflin Hill Symphony Orchestra\, and she regularly performs as a 
 violinist in chamber\, music\, ensembles for weddings\, corporate events\,
  and private concerts. Unique to Lynne’s musical offerings is a highly s
 pecialized\, one of a kind\, participatory\, strolling VioLynne entertainm
 ent program. Although it was designed for senior living communities and se
 nior centers Lynne’s program is enjoyed by all ages. She will entertain 
 us with a variety of music while playing the violin\, singing\, and a givi
 ng little bit of history behind some of the songs. Look forward to an hour
  of upbeat music from patriotic\, big band\, Disney and other genres. Suit
 able for almost any age\, enjoyed by all. Children taking violin lessons m
 ay especially enjoy her talent and be inspired by her program. As a vocali
 st\, Lynne performs regularly with the Allen Whitney Jazz Ensemble special
