BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mark Guiliana
DTSTART:20261023T000000
DTEND:20261023T000000
DTSTAMP:20261017T144006Z
UID:42774eebab6073734c291dfb433474@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Born out of relentless exploration of rhythm and sonic texture
 s\, BEAT MUSIC pulses with an electrifying fusion of jazz\, electronic\, a
 nd experimental sounds\, captivating audiences worldwide with its dynamic 
 and innovative performances. Led by visionary drummer and composer Mark Gu
 iliana(Opens in a new window)\, the ensemble pushes the boundaries of cont
 emporary music\, creating a sonic journey that defies categorization. On h
 is forthcoming release\, Beat Music 2.0\, Guiliana's compositional voice i
 s on full display alongside the energetic\, precise grooves that define hi
 s singular approach. In an age increasingly shaped by automation\, Beat Mu
 sic 2.0 remains focused on human connection and collaboration. Featuring N
 icholas Semrad (Empire of the Sun)\, Stu Brooks (Nine Inch Nails\, Danny E
 lfman)\, Tim Lefebvre (David Bowie)\, and vocalist Gretchen Parlato\, this
  hard-hitting\, synth-fueled album distills Guiliana's vision into eight c
 inematic compositions that fuse retro-inspired production with forward-thi
 nking musicianship. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS Sources: Meet Boston Event pa
 ge: https://www.meetboston.com/event/mark-guiliana/92150/\n\nEvents Near M
 e: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback f
 rom massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/even
 t/mark-guiliana/92150/
LOCATION:The Red Room at Cafe 939\, 939 Boylston St\, Boston\, MA\, 02115
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/mark-guiliana/92150/
END:VEVENT
