UID:234fc9738e997168cd67968131145d@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Rural Remains is a theatrical event that brings history to lif
 e with costumed actors\, lantern lit paths\, and true tales from Worcester
 ’s past set in historic Rural Cemetery. Attendees will hear the fascinat
 ing stories of notable Worcester leaders interred there as they are guided
  to multiple different grave sites by flashlight. Tour time slots offered 
 between 5:30pm and 8:00pm. Tours last about an hour and require 1 mile of 
 walking in the dark by flashlight. The material is not recommended for chi
 ldren under 13 years of age. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event
  page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/rural-remains/31021/\n\nEve
 nts Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local 
