 acilitate these important conversations. During the session\, you will lea
 rn practical ways to step in and support others in situations involving se
 xual violence\, harassment\, or discrimination. The training focuses on ho
 w we can look out for one another and help create a safer\, more caring ca
 mpus community. At Holy Cross\, being “people for and with others” is 
