  Space\, Peter and Paul will be hosting Fr Peter Nguyen for his talk “Fa
 ith & Virtues\,” which is part of our "Questiones et Dubia" series. "Que
 stiones et Dubia" is focused on explaining challenging parts of Catholic C
 hurch doctrine and allowing us all to discuss and ask questions so as to f
